---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroBanner from '../components/HeroBanner.astro';
import ProfessionalClusterNav from '../components/ProfessionalClusterNav.astro';

const title = 'Portugal HQA Visa Lawyer - When Legal Counsel Helps';
const metaTitle = `${title} | Portugal HQA Residency`;
const metaDescription =
  'Portugal HQA visa lawyer work in 2026 is legal advice on the host, the pack, and the post. Use counsel when the facts are not a standard employed file.';
---

<Layout title={metaTitle} description={metaDescription}>
  <article>
    <header>
      <HeroBanner
        image="/images/portugal-hqa-visa-lawyer-consultation.jpg"
        alt="Man walking away down a cobbled lane past a green Volkswagen Beetle and a Centro Comercial sign"
        title={title}
        items={[
          { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
          { href: '/portugal-hqa-visa', label: 'Portugal HQA Visa' },
          { label: 'Lawyer' },
        ]}
      />
      <div class="bg-background">
        <div class="site-container py-24 md:py-32">
        <p class="max-w-3xl">
          Portugal HQA visa lawyer work is legal advice on whether the activity, the host, and the applicant fit highly qualified activity residence, and on how that file should be lodged. It is not a requirement for every employed case. A straightforward contract, a complete pack, and a post that publishes a clear 2026 list can proceed without counsel. Use a lawyer when the facts are disputed, the host structure is unusual, or a refusal would be costly.
        </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-background-alt">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <section>
          <h2>When legal advice is the right spend</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Typical reasons: the host is a group of entities rather than one Portuguese employer; the person is already in Portugal on another heading; family civil-status documents are incomplete; a prior refusal exists; or the post has asked a legal question rather than a missing stamp. Counsel reads the statute and the current instructions against those facts. Document logistics without legal analysis belong on the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-consultant" class="inline-link">HQA visa consultant</a>
            page.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>What a lawyer does not replace</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Counsel does not create a qualifying role. The tests remain on
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-requirements" class="inline-link">HQA visa requirements</a>.
            Counsel does not set AIMA queues. Lodging still follows the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-application" class="inline-link">HQA visa application</a>
            path. Legal fees are one line in
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-cost" class="inline-link">HQA visa cost</a>,
            not a government tariff.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-24">
          <h2>How this sits next to the program guide</h2>
          <p class="mt-6">
            Tax residency is a separate professional. Immigration advice is not a US or Portuguese tax return. US households that still file in the United States should read
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-for-americans" class="inline-link">HQA visa for Americans</a>
            next to the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa-tax" class="inline-link">HQA visa tax</a>
            page. The program overview is the
            <a href="/portugal-hqa-visa" class="inline-link">Portugal HQA visa</a>
            guide.
          </p>
        </section>

        <ProfessionalClusterNav current="/portugal-hqa-visa-lawyer" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="bg-background">
      <div class="site-container max-w-3xl py-24 md:py-32">
        <p class="max-w-2xl">
          This page is informational. It is not legal, tax, or immigration advice. If the host or the civil-status pack needs a legal opinion, write to the advisory desk. There is no evaluation form on this page.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="text-link mt-8">
          Write if the file needs a legal opinion <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
